{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Absorb, Split, and Possess. Guide &quot;Tama&quot; the slime cat through obstacles in this action-puzzle adventure.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tama In-Between</i> is a 2D action-puzzle game where you control a mysterious slime cat named Tama on a journey through a strange world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's core feature is the ability to split your body and transfer your soul into another form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the recoil from splitting to dash through the air, or warp by transferring your soul to a distant copy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a blend of gameplay that tests both your reflexes with high-speed action and your flexibility with clever puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Keys to Victory: Absorb, Split, and Possess</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master Tama's three special abilities to solve the mysteries of each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Absorb</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reabsorb slimes or copies on the stage to regain your size and prepare for your next split.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/01667e8b046815a671de1adc675fff8e.poster.avif?t=1765636919\" width=200 height=78 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/01667e8b046815a671de1adc675fff8e.webm?t=1765636919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/01667e8b046815a671de1adc675fff8e.mp4?t=1765636919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Split</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split your body to leave a &quot;copy&quot; behind or reach high places. The recoil can also be used as a dash for movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/b4dd1bc0b057905eccd3e4e2e9b8600b.poster.avif?t=1765636919\" width=200 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/b4dd1bc0b057905eccd3e4e2e9b8600b.webm?t=1765636919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/b4dd1bc0b057905eccd3e4e2e9b8600b.mp4?t=1765636919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Possess</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instantly transfer your soul (control) to a copy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/1a453e3146e8e960ca98c82cfbab281e.poster.avif?t=1765636919\" width=200 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/1a453e3146e8e960ca98c82cfbab281e.webm?t=1765636919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769030/extras/1a453e3146e8e960ca98c82cfbab281e.mp4?t=1765636919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming &amp; Content Creation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to upload gameplay videos, streams, and screenshots of this game for both commercial and non-commercial purposes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, please refrain from using the content for illegal purposes or in a manner that violates public order and morals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground